  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nEach time you take effect damage while you
    control a Fairy Monster Card in your other Pendulum Zone, place 1 Resonance Counter
    on this card. Monsters your opponent controls lose 100 ATK for each Resonance
    Counter on your field.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf this card is in your hand:
    You can discard 1 other card; take 1 \"Angello Vaalmonica\" from your Deck, and
    place this card and that card in your Pendulum Zones. During your Main Phase,
    if this card was Normal or Special Summoned this turn: You can banish 1 \"Vaalmonica\"
    Normal Spell/Trap from your GY; apply whichever effect on that card includes
    taking damage. You can only use each effect of \"Dimonno Vaalmonica\" once per
    turn."
